From 63e985eae5abb600c930a5e825305f2af652fe04 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 21:12:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/24] Test sticky write failures in WalTransactionBoundary
 and Issue2821

A failed confirmation write and a transient disk-full log write now leave
the engine read-only (decision 6, default B): reads return the last
committed rows, Rollback completes the ended transaction, the next write
throws with the recorded failure as its inner exception before it changes
either stream, and a reopen retries and accepts writes again.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UFnsmor6qyZMSd1VoKwfJh
---
 .../Internals/WalTransactionBoundary_Tests.cs | 18 +++++++--
 LiteDB.Tests/Issues/Issue2821_Tests.cs        | 39 ++++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 45 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/LiteDB.Tests/Internals/WalTransactionBoundary_Tests.cs b/LiteDB.Tests/Internals/WalTransactionBoundary_Tests.cs
